## Summary

**Screens & components annotated** (89 hinted elements):
- **Sidebar (shared)** — `nav.sidebar` collection with folded `nav.item.<slug>` navigation links (dashboard, transactions, categories, reports, tax-summary)
- **Dashboard** — 4 stat cards as observables (`dashboard.stats.*` with state keys `balance.total`, `month.income/expenses/profit`); `dashboard.recent` collection keyed by `tx-N` with `.meta`/`.amount` per item
- **Transactions** — `transactions.add`; `transactions.filters` region (search input, type/category selects with `data-semtag-options` built from the same `categories` array that renders the menu, date-from/to, clear — all with `controls → transactions.table`); `transactions.table` collection keyed `tx-N` with `.date`, `.category`, `.amount`, `.edit`, `.delete` and an item id on the description cell; summary totals; empty-state observable; delete-confirm dialog region
- **Transaction dialog** — `transaction.form` region: type/category selects (options from live data), date, description, amount, reference, notes inputs, tax-related toggle, cancel/submit
- **Categories** — `categories.income` and `categories.expense` collections keyed `cat-N` (collection id threaded through the shared `CategoryCard` via a new `collectionId` prop) with `.count`, `.total`, `.edit`, `.delete`; add button; delete dialog; `category.form` dialog with color picker as a folded `option` collection keyed by color name, `selected` state literal on the active swatch
- **Reports** — `reports.month` select (options from `monthOptions`); 3 summary observables; `reports.income-by-category` / `reports.expenses-by-category` collections keyed by slugified category name; empty-state observables
- **Tax Summary** — `tax.year` select, `tax.print`; 3 summary observables; `tax.income-table` / `tax.expense-table` (keyed `cat-N`, attributes omitted entirely for unknown categories rather than half-formed) and `tax.transactions` (keyed `tx-N`) collections; transaction count observable
- **404** — `notfound.home` navigation

**Id namespaces:** `nav`, `dashboard`, `transactions`, `transaction.form`, `categories`, `category.form`, `reports`, `tax`, `notfound`.

**Permitted prop-widening (only non-attribute code change):** `StatCard` now extends `ComponentProps<'p'>` and spreads onto its value element; `CategoryCard` (local to Categories.tsx) takes a `collectionId` prop for collection-scoped ids.

**Deliberately unhinted:** the recharts SVG charts (Monthly/Expense/Daily charts) — their values aren't extractable as element text; the equivalent numbers are exposed via the summary observables. Also table total rows in Tax Summary (duplicate the summary-card observables) and decorative icons/wrappers.

